===Norway vs Mexico===

The only goal of the game (in what was Norway's first World Cup victory) was scored by [[Kjetil Rekdal]] in the 85th minute when the referee let the game continue after a foul on [[Jan Åge Fjørtoft]] close to the Mexican penalty area. The goalscorer entered the game minutes before the decisive strike.<ref>[https://www.baltimoresun.com/news/bs-xpm-1994-06-20-1994171003-story.html Norway efficient, effective in 1-0 victory WORLD CUP 1994]</ref>

